      <div className="bg-amber-50 rounded-3xl border border-amber-200 p-6">
        <p className="text-[10px] font-black text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2 leading-relaxed">
          <svg className="w-3 h-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7-4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zM9 9a1 1 0 000 2v3a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 100-2v-3a1 1 0 00-1-1H9z"></path></svg>
          Note: These schedules are for operational reconciliation and analysis. They perform sub-ledger detail splitting to atomize single Amazon transactions into their component sales and fees.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};

